<title>NORWAY: Dyno agrees $300 mln multi-currency loan.</title>
<headline>Dyno agrees $300 mln multi-currency loan.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian explosives and chemicals company Dyno ASA said on Thursday it had reached an agreement to take out a multi-currency loan totalling $300 million.</p>
<p>The loan will run for seven years and has been arranged by ABN Amro Bank N.V. and Royal Bank of Canada Europe Ltd.</p>
</text>
